  "notable_quotes": [
    "In situ gas adsorption PXRD showed reversible switching between narrow-pore and open-pore phases during gas uptake in these MOFs.",
    "The phase transformations are governed by local coordination flexibility around the open metal site in [Zn2(trz)2(cdc)].",
    "The pillared triazolate 3D-linker MOFs [Zn2(trz)2(cdc)] and [Zn2(trz)2(Br-cdc)] retain permanent porosity after activation while remaining flexible and selectively adsorbing gases."
